                        <html>
                          <p>
                            Global Prescaler Bits (GPRE[0:7] in EMIOS_MCR_A register).
                            The bits select the clock divider value for the global prescaler.
                            The allowed values are 0 up to 255 (divide ratio 1 up to 256).
                          </p>
                          <p> Note:implementation specific parameter.</p>
                        </html>
                        ]]>
                      </a:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS" type="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS">
                      <icc:v class="PreCompile">VariantPreCompile</icc:v>
                      <icc:v class="PostBuild">VariantPostBuild</icc:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="ORIGIN" value="Freescale" />
                    <a:a name="SYMBOLICNAMEVALUE" value="false" />
                    <a:a name="UUID" value="ECUC:527cca2b-b8be-4164-9f06-e5ca588e1919" />
                    <a:da name="DEFAULT" value="0" />
                    <a:a name="ENABLE" value="true" />
                    <a:da name="INVALID" type="Range">
                       <a:tst expr="&lt;=255"/>
                       <a:tst expr="&gt;=0"/>
                    </a:da>
                  </v:var>
                  <v:var name="MdisBit" type="BOOLEAN">
                    <a:a name="DESC">
                      <a:v>
                        <![CDATA[EN:
                        <html>
                          <p>
                          Check this to put the eMIOS200 in low power mode. The MDIS bit is used to stop the clock
                          of the block, except the access to registers EMIOSMCR, EMIOSOUDIS and EMIOSUCDIS.
                          </p>
                          <p> Note:implementation specific parameter.</p>
                        </html>
                        ]]>
                      </a:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS" type="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS">
                      <icc:v class="PreCompile">VariantPreCompile</icc:v>
                      <icc:v class="PostBuild">VariantPostBuild</icc:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="ORIGIN" value="Freescale" />
                    <a:a name="LABEL" value="Mdis Bit" />
                    <a:a name="SYMBOLICNAMEVALUE" value="false" />
                    <a:a name="UUID" value="ECUC:d43228fb-fef9-4172-97d1-6e5d21cf94fc" />
                    <a:da name="DEFAULT" value="true" />
                    <a:a name="ENABLE" value="true" />
                  </v:var>
                  <v:var name="GlobalTimeBaseEnable" type="BOOLEAN">
                    <a:a name="DESC">
                      <a:v>
                        <![CDATA[EN:
                        <html>
                          <p>
                            Global Time Base Enable Bit (GTBE in EMIOS_MCR register).The GTBE bit is used to export
                            a global time base enable from the module and provide a method to start time bases of several
                            blocks simultaneously.
                          </p>
                        </html>
                        ]]>
                      </a:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS" type="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS">
                      <icc:v class="PreCompile">VariantPreCompile</icc:v>
                      <icc:v class="PostBuild">VariantPostBuild</icc:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="ORIGIN" value="Freescale" />
                    <a:a name="LABEL" value="Global Time Base Enable" />
                    <a:a name="SYMBOLICNAMEVALUE" value="false" />
                    <a:a name="UUID" value="ECUC:fe333203-caaa-4456-b2f4-3ab0da4e673d" />
                    <a:da name="DEFAULT" value="true" />
                  </v:var>
                  <v:var name="FreezeBit" type="BOOLEAN">
                    <a:a name="DESC">
                      <a:v>
                        <![CDATA[EN:
                        <html>
                          <p>
                            Freeze Bit (FRZ in EMIOS_MCR_A register).Enable the eMIOS200 to freeze the registers
                            of the unified channels when debug mode is requested at MCU level. Each unified channel
                            must have FREN bit set in order to enter freeze mode.
                          </p>
                        </html>
                        ]]>
                      </a:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS" type="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS">
                      <icc:v class="PreCompile">VariantPreCompile</icc:v>
                      <icc:v class="PostBuild">VariantPostBuild</icc:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="ORIGIN" value="Freescale" />
                    <a:a name="LABEL" value="Freeze Bit" />
                    <a:a name="SYMBOLICNAMEVALUE" value="false" />
                    <a:a name="UUID" value="ECUC:d4bbb3fb-fcc9-4151-97d1-aa5d21cf94fb" />
                    <a:da name="DEFAULT" value="false" />
                  </v:var>
                  <v:var name="GlobalPrescalerEnable" type="BOOLEAN">
                    <a:a name="DESC">
                      <a:v>
                        <![CDATA[EN:
                        <html>
                          <p>
                          Select the clock source clock. </p>
                          <p>Note:implementation specific parameter.
                          </p>
                        </html>
                        ]]>
                      </a:v>
                    </a:a>
                    <a:a name="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS" type="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS">
                      <icc:v class="PreCompile">VariantPreCompile</icc:v>
