                                                    </p> </html>
                                                    ]]></a:v>
                                                </a:a>
                                            <a:a name="UUID" value="ECUC:5a77dd6e-aaa8-42d4-b459-17b3092f3e77"/>
                                            <v:var name="McuEnableReset" type="BOOLEAN">
                                                <a:a name="DESC">
                                                    <a:v><![CDATA[EN:
                                                             <html> <p>
                                                    If flagged the <b>RESET</b> occurs, else no reset occurs and <b>ISR</b> or <b>SAFE</b> (it depends from McuEnableInterrupt) should be actived.
                                                    </p> </html>
                                                    ]]></a:v>
                                                </a:a>
                                                <a:a name="COLUMN_TITLE" value="Enable Reset"/>
                                                <a:a name="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS" type="IMPLEMENTATIONCONFIGCLASS">
                                                  <icc:v class="PreCompile">VariantPreCompile</icc:v>
                                                  <icc:v class="PostBuild">VariantPostBuild</icc:v>
                                                </a:a>
                                                <a:a name="ORIGIN" value="Freescale"/>
                                                <a:a name="UUID" value="ECUC:51eeb516-a493-4a4f-82f7-c04e56614c8a" />
                                                <a:a name="LABEL" value="Enable RESET"/>
                                                <a:da name="DEFAULT" value="true"/>
                                            </v:var>
                                            <v:var name="McuEnableInterrupt" type="BOOLEAN">
                                                <a:a name="DESC">
                                                    <a:v><![CDATA[EN:
                                                             <html> <p>
                                                    If enabled the  <b>ISR </b> event occurs else the  <b>SAFE </b> event occurs. </p> 
                                                    <p> Note: be aware that in the case of Bolero 256K, it is not recommended to select to enter in safe mode if you intend to select external oscillator as your system clock source. In this case, it i possible to have deadlock situation as detailed in errata e3220.
                                                    </p> </html>
                                                    ]]></a:v>
                                                </a:a>
